    Group.IsPerfect (St A) ∧ True := by sorry

/-- V.1/k3-h3-steinberg: the isomorphism `K₃(A) ≃ H₃(St(A), ℤ)`. Stated against
the imported K-groups; the right-hand side is Mathlib group homology. -/
